25:["$","section","method",{"id":"method","children":["$undefined",["$","span",null,{"className":"reading-section-number","children":"05"}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Method & Worked Example"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"section-question","children":"沿着输入、处理、输出走完 Pipeline。"}],[["$","div","0",{"className":"analysis-block analysis-paper","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"claim-label claim-paper","children":"Paper Claim"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"通过统一定义和多轴文献分类，整理 reward feedback、示范学习、population 演化等机制；按静态、短期适应和长期 continual learning 梳理评测范式，并分析跨领域迁移、成本比较及 multi-Agent collaboration 的研究缺口。"}],"$undefined",["$","div",null,{"className":"block-citations","children":[["$","a","paper",{"href":"#reference-paper","aria-label":"来源 1: A Survey of Self-Evolving Agents: What, When, How, and Where to Evolve on the Path to Artificial Super Intelligence · v4","children":["[",1,"]"]}]]}]]}],["$","div","1",{"className":"analysis-block analysis-inference","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"claim-label claim-inference","children":"Inference"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"用 Voyager 作具体分类：What 涉及可执行 Skill 与经验记录，When 发生在持续交互过程中，How 使用环境反馈、代码生成和检索，Where 是 Minecraft。再看 ADAS，主要变化是目标 Agent Architecture。这里是按 Survey 视角进行的教学映射；是否证明 Recursive Gain 仍要回到各论文的实验。"}],"$undefined",["$","div",null,{"className":"block-citations","children":[["$","a","paper",{"href":"#reference-paper","aria-label":"来源 1: A Survey of Self-Evolving Agents: What, When, How, and Where to Evolve on the Path to Artificial Super Intelligence · v4","children":["[",1,"]"]}]]}]]}]]]}]]}]
